Changed: The visco-plastic material model now uses a reaction chain to
validate and clamp reaction-progress values before updating equation-of-state
properties. Existing kinetics models can be parsed and evaluated without a
simulator, while simulation initialization provides simulator access to the
kinetics models. The material model validates that the reaction count matches its
reaction-progress compositional fields. Cases without reaction-progress
fields remain supported when the kinetics list is empty.
<br>
(Haoyuan Li, 2026/11/15)
